OL,3,ARussia accuses Ukraine of attacking oil
OL,4,Arefinery after Zelensky says strikes to
OL,5,Aresume
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia has accused Ukraine of attacking
OL,8,Fan oil refinery on Thursday after
OL,9,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said such
OL,10,Fstrikes, halted at the request of the
OL,11,FUS, would resume.
OL,13,FZelensky said he had restricted attacks
OL,14,Ffor three days while Russia continued
OL,15,Fstriking Ukraine's energy
OL,16,Finfrastructure. "We're done," he told
OL,17,Fthe Financial Times.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
